I, {{patient_name}}, consent to dental implant treatment ({{procedure}}) by {{doctor_name}} at {{clinic_name}}.

The surgical procedure, healing period, prosthetic phase, costs and alternatives (bridge, denture, no replacement) have been explained to me. I understand the risks include pain, swelling, bleeding, infection, injury to nerves causing numbness, sinus involvement, failure of the implant to integrate with bone, and the need for bone grafting or additional procedures. I understand that smoking, diabetes and poor oral hygiene reduce the success of implants and that regular follow-up is required.

Date: {{date}}

I, {{patient_name}} (or parent/guardian), consent to orthodontic treatment ({{procedure}}) by {{doctor_name}} at {{clinic_name}}.

I understand that treatment time is an estimate and depends on my co-operation, that regular visits and good oral hygiene are essential, and that risks include tooth decay or white spots around braces, gum inflammation, root shortening, discomfort, and relapse if retainers are not worn as advised. The fee and payment schedule have been explained to me.

Date: {{date}}
